        {
          "index": 1,
          "type": "input",
          "title": "You'll want to know: లేదా",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "లేదా (lēdā) — \"or\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "You have met its first half already: లే- is the same root behind లేదు, \"there isn't\". లేదా (lēdā) is literally the or-else of that root — \"failing that\"."
            },
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "టీ లేదా (lēdā) పాలు? — \"tea or milk?\" That is the whole of an offered choice, and you can now make one."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "index": 2,
          "type": "notice",
          "title": "What you've built",
          "segments": [
            {
              "kind": "speech",
              "text": "A choice you can put to somebody."
            }
          ]
        },
        {
